 "pitfalls": [
  "valueFloatChange only sets a constant; incrementing needs valueFloatExpressionChange with an expression that reads the target (\"@count + 1\")",
  "textFromFloat `whole` is the number of integer digits kept (3 here, enough up to 999), and inside a text value `decimal` defaults to 3, so set \"decimal\": 0 for a whole number",
  "Declare the state as a root-level variable before the components that read it; the onClick actions then target it by name (\"@count\")",
  "Fixed-width buttons (size 120×48) overflow when the host is narrower than the header: give them weight 1 with widthIn [0, 120] so they shrink but never grow past 120, and separate them with a fixed spacer box, since weights ignore spacedBy"
 ],
